menu "Mock radio: web console"

    config MOCK_WEB_CONSOLE
        bool "Web console over Wi-Fi"
        default y
        help
            A page to change the mock's settings and watch what it is doing,
            reached over Wi-Fi while a modem application holds the CAT port.
            It uses no USB endpoint. With this off and the two-board link
            not on ESP-NOW, the 2.4 GHz radio stays silent, for example while
            judging USB audio on its own.

endmenu
